{"seq":2,"slug":"ggplot2-visualization","title":"ggplot2 可视化体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/tidyverse/ggplot2-visualization","wordCount":976,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"ggplot2-可视化体系\">ggplot2 可视化体系</h1><p>ggplot2 基于 Leland Wilkinson 的《The Grammar of Graphics》理论，将统计图形分解为数据、映射、几何对象、统计变换、坐标系和分面六个正交组件。2025 年发布的 ggplot2 4.0 完成了从 ggproto 到 S7 对象系统的迁移，带来更好的继承机制和类型安全，同时保持了面向用户的 API 不变。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>图形语法把图形分解为六个正交组件</strong>：数据、美学映射、几何对象、统计变换、标度、坐标系，分面与主题是叠加其上的修饰层。</li>\n<li><strong><code>aes()</code> 内是数据驱动的映射，<code>aes()</code> 外是固定设置</strong>——这是 ggplot2 最容易混淆也最关键的一条区分。</li>\n<li><strong>每个 <code>geom_*</code> 背后都有默认 <code>stat_*</code></strong>：<code>geom_bar()</code> 实为 <code>stat_count()</code>，<code>geom_smooth()</code> 实为 <code>stat_smooth()</code>。</li>\n<li><strong>标度决定映射的具体实现</strong>：数据值如何落到颜色、位置、大小上，是&quot;连续 vs 离散&quot;的枢纽。</li>\n<li><strong>分面按变量切分面板</strong>，是替代手写循环出图的标准做法。</li>\n<li><strong>主题只管非数据元素</strong>（背景、网格、字体、图例），与数据映射完全分离。</li>\n<li><strong>4.0 完成 S7 迁移但 API 向后兼容</strong>——日常使用者无需修改代码。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"图形语法的层次结构\">图形语法的层次结构</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[ggplot 对象] --&gt; B[数据 data]&#10;    A --&gt; C[美学映射 aes]&#10;    A --&gt; D[几何图层 geom_*]&#10;    A --&gt; E[统计变换 stat_*]&#10;    A --&gt; F[标度 scale_*]&#10;    A --&gt; G[坐标系 coord_*]&#10;    A --&gt; H[分面 facet_*]&#10;    A --&gt; I[主题 theme]&#10;    D --&gt; J[position 调整]&#10;    F --&gt; K[颜色/形状/大小标度]\">graph TD\n    A[ggplot 对象] --&gt; B[数据 data]\n    A --&gt; C[美学映射 aes]\n    A --&gt; D[几何图层 geom_*]\n    A --&gt; E[统计变换 stat_*]\n    A --&gt; F[标度 scale_*]\n    A --&gt; G[坐标系 coord_*]\n    A --&gt; H[分面 facet_*]\n    A --&gt; I[主题 theme]\n    D --&gt; J[position 调整]\n    F --&gt; K[颜色/形状/大小标度]</pre><p>每个 ggplot 图形的构建遵循相同模式——声明数据和映射，叠加图层，调整标度和主题：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"library(ggplot2)&#10;&#10;ggplot(penguins, aes(x = bill_length_mm, y = bill_depth_mm)) +&#10;  geom_point(aes(color = species, shape = species), size = 2, alpha = 0.7) +&#10;  geom_smooth(method = &quot;lm&quot;, se = TRUE, linewidth = 0.8) +&#10;  scale_color_brewer(palette = &quot;Set2&quot;) +&#10;  labs(&#10;    title = &quot;企鹅喙部形态学关系&quot;,&#10;    x = &quot;喙长 (mm)&quot;,&#10;    y = &quot;喙深 (mm)&quot;,&#10;    color = &quot;物种&quot;,&#10;    shape = &quot;物种&quot;&#10;  ) +&#10;  theme_minimal(base_size = 12)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>library(ggplot2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ggplot(penguins, aes(x = bill_length_mm, y = bill_depth_mm)) +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  geom_point(aes(color = species, shape = species), size = 2, alpha = 0.7) +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  geom_smooth(method = \"lm\", se = TRUE, linewidth = 0.8) +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  scale_color_brewer(palette = \"Set2\") +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  labs(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    title = \"企鹅喙部形态学关系\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    x = \"喙长 (mm)\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    y = \"喙深 (mm)\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    color = \"物种\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    shape = \"物种\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ) +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  theme_minimal(base_size = 12)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"美学映射-aesthetics\">美学映射（Aesthetics）</h2><p>美学映射是数据变量到视觉属性的绑定。<code>aes()</code> 内的映射是数据驱动的；<code>aes()</code> 外的设置是固定值：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 映射：颜色由 species 变量决定&#10;geom_point(aes(color = species))&#10;&#10;# 设置：所有点都是蓝色&#10;geom_point(color = &quot;steelblue&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 映射：颜色由 species 变量决定</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>geom_point(aes(color = species))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 设置：所有点都是蓝色</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>geom_point(color = \"steelblue\")</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>美学属性</th>\n<th>适用变量类型</th>\n<th>常见几何</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>x</code>, <code>y</code></td>\n<td>连续/离散</td>\n<td>所有</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>color</code>/<code>fill</code></td>\n<td>连续 → 渐变；离散 → 调色板</td>\n<td>point, bar, area</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>size</code></td>\n<td>连续</td>\n<td>point, text</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>shape</code></td>\n<td>离散（≤6 级）</td>\n<td>point</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>alpha</code></td>\n<td>连续（0-1）</td>\n<td>所有</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>linetype</code></td>\n<td>离散</td>\n<td>line, path</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>group</code></td>\n<td>离散（不产生图例）</td>\n<td>line, polygon</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"图层继承\">图层继承</h3><p>全局 <code>aes()</code> 被所有图层继承，图层内的 <code>aes()</code> 覆盖或补充：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"ggplot(df, aes(x = date, y = value, color = group)) +&#10;  geom_line() +              # 继承全局映射&#10;  geom_point(aes(size = n))  # 补充 size 映射\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>ggplot(df, aes(x = date, y = value, color = group)) +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  geom_line() +              # 继承全局映射</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  geom_point(aes(size = n))  # 补充 size 映射</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"几何对象全景\">几何对象全景</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 散点图&#10;geom_point()&#10;&#10;# 线图（连接观测）&#10;geom_line()&#10;geom_path()    # 按数据顺序连接（非 x 轴排序）&#10;&#10;# 柱状图&#10;geom_bar(stat = &quot;count&quot;)     # 计数&#10;geom_col()                    # 值已计算&#10;&#10;# 直方图与密度&#10;geom_histogram(binwidth = 0.5)&#10;geom_density(fill = &quot;lightblue&quot;, alpha = 0.5)&#10;&#10;# 箱线图与小提琴图&#10;geom_boxplot()&#10;geom_violin()&#10;&#10;# 面积图&#10;geom_area()&#10;geom_ribbon(aes(ymin = lower, ymax = upper))&#10;&#10;# 瓦片图（热力图）&#10;geom_tile(aes(fill = value))&#10;&#10;# 文本标注&#10;geom_text(aes(label = name), size = 3)&#10;geom_label(aes(label = name))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 散点图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>geom_point()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 线图（连接观测）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>geom_line()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>geom_path()    # 按数据顺序连接（非 x 轴排序）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 柱状图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>geom_bar(stat = \"count\")     # 计数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>geom_col()                    # 值已计算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 直方图与密度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>geom_histogram(binwidth = 0.5)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>geom_density(fill = \"lightblue\", alpha = 0.5)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 箱线图与小提琴图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>geom_boxplot()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>geom_violin()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 面积图</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>geom_area()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>geom_ribbon(aes(ymin = lower, ymax = upper))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 瓦片图（热力图）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>geom_tile(aes(fill = value))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 文本标注</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>geom_text(aes(label = name), size = 3)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>geom_label(aes(label = name))</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"统计变换\">统计变换</h2><p>每个 <code>geom_*</code> 背后都有一个默认 <code>stat_*</code>。例如 <code>geom_bar()</code> 使用 <code>stat_count()</code>，<code>geom_smooth()</code> 使用 <code>stat_smooth()</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 显式使用统计变换&#10;ggplot(penguins, aes(x = species)) +&#10;  stat_count(geom = &quot;bar&quot;)&#10;&#10;# 等价于&#10;ggplot(penguins, aes(x = species)) +&#10;  geom_bar()&#10;&#10;# 二维密度等高线&#10;ggplot(penguins, aes(x = bill_length_mm, y = bill_depth_mm)) +&#10;  geom_density_2d_filled(alpha = 0.7) +&#10;  geom_point(size = 0.5)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 显式使用统计变换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ggplot(penguins, aes(x = species)) +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  stat_count(geom = \"bar\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 等价于</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ggplot(penguins, aes(x = species)) +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  geom_bar()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 二维密度等高线</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ggplot(penguins, aes(x = bill_length_mm, y = bill_depth_mm)) +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  geom_density_2d_filled(alpha = 0.7) +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  geom_point(size = 0.5)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"标度系统\">标度系统</h2><p>标度控制美学映射的具体实现——数据值如何对应到颜色、位置、大小：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 颜色标度&#10;scale_color_manual(values = c(&quot;A&quot; = &quot;#E41A1C&quot;, &quot;B&quot; = &quot;#377EB8&quot;))&#10;scale_color_gradient(low = &quot;white&quot;, high = &quot;darkred&quot;)&#10;scale_color_viridis_c()     # 连续型色盲友好&#10;scale_color_viridis_d()     # 离散型&#10;&#10;# 坐标轴标度&#10;scale_x_continuous(breaks = seq(0, 100, 20), labels = scales::comma)&#10;scale_y_log10()&#10;scale_x_date(date_breaks = &quot;3 months&quot;, date_labels = &quot;%Y-%m&quot;)&#10;&#10;# 大小标度&#10;scale_size_area(max_size = 10)  # 面积正比于值\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 颜色标度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>scale_color_manual(values = c(\"A\" = \"#E41A1C\", \"B\" = \"#377EB8\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>scale_color_gradient(low = \"white\", high = \"darkred\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>scale_color_viridis_c()     # 连续型色盲友好</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>scale_color_viridis_d()     # 离散型</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 坐标轴标度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>scale_x_continuous(breaks = seq(0, 100, 20), labels = scales::comma)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>scale_y_log10()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>scale_x_date(date_breaks = \"3 months\", date_labels = \"%Y-%m\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 大小标度</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>scale_size_area(max_size = 10)  # 面积正比于值</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>标度类型</th>\n<th>连续变量</th>\n<th>离散变量</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>颜色</td>\n<td><code>scale_color_gradient()</code></td>\n<td><code>scale_color_manual()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>填充</td>\n<td><code>scale_fill_gradient2()</code></td>\n<td><code>scale_fill_brewer()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>x 轴</td>\n<td><code>scale_x_continuous()</code></td>\n<td><code>scale_x_discrete()</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大小</td>\n<td><code>scale_size()</code></td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"分面-faceting\">分面（Faceting）</h2><p>分面将数据按一个或多个变量分割为子图面板：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 按单变量分面（自动布局）&#10;ggplot(penguins, aes(x = bill_length_mm, y = body_mass_g)) +&#10;  geom_point() +&#10;  facet_wrap(~ species, nrow = 1)&#10;&#10;# 按两个变量交叉分面（网格布局）&#10;ggplot(penguins, aes(x = bill_length_mm, y = body_mass_g)) +&#10;  geom_point() +&#10;  facet_grid(sex ~ species)&#10;&#10;# 自由坐标轴&#10;facet_wrap(~ species, scales = &quot;free_y&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 按单变量分面（自动布局）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ggplot(penguins, aes(x = bill_length_mm, y = body_mass_g)) +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  geom_point() +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  facet_wrap(~ species, nrow = 1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 按两个变量交叉分面（网格布局）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ggplot(penguins, aes(x = bill_length_mm, y = body_mass_g)) +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  geom_point() +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  facet_grid(sex ~ species)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 自由坐标轴</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>facet_wrap(~ species, scales = \"free_y\")</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"主题定制\">主题定制</h2><p>主题控制非数据元素的外观——背景、网格线、字体、图例位置：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"ggplot(penguins, aes(x = species, y = body_mass_g, fill = species)) +&#10;  geom_boxplot(show.legend = FALSE) +&#10;  theme_minimal(base_size = 14) +&#10;  theme(&#10;    plot.title = element_text(face = &quot;bold&quot;, size = 16),&#10;    axis.text.x = element_text(angle = 0, hjust = 0.5),&#10;    panel.grid.minor = element_blank(),&#10;    legend.position = &quot;bottom&quot;&#10;  )\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>ggplot(penguins, aes(x = species, y = body_mass_g, fill = species)) +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  geom_boxplot(show.legend = FALSE) +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  theme_minimal(base_size = 14) +</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  theme(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    plot.title = element_text(face = \"bold\", size = 16),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    axis.text.x = element_text(angle = 0, hjust = 0.5),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    panel.grid.minor = element_blank(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    legend.position = \"bottom\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  )</span></span></code></pre></div><p>内置主题：<code>theme_gray()</code>（默认）、<code>theme_minimal()</code>、<code>theme_bw()</code>、<code>theme_classic()</code>、<code>theme_void()</code>、<code>theme_dark()</code>。</p>\n<p>ggthemes、hrbrthemes、tvthemes 等扩展包提供更多预设主题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"坐标系\">坐标系</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 翻转 x/y&#10;coord_flip()&#10;&#10;# 固定纵横比&#10;coord_fixed(ratio = 1)&#10;&#10;# 极坐标（饼图 / 玫瑰图）&#10;coord_polar(theta = &quot;y&quot;)&#10;&#10;# 地图投影&#10;coord_sf(crs = 4326)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 翻转 x/y</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>coord_flip()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 固定纵横比</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>coord_fixed(ratio = 1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 极坐标（饼图 / 玫瑰图）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>coord_polar(theta = \"y\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 地图投影</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>coord_sf(crs = 4326)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"组合与输出\">组合与输出</h2><h3 id=\"patchwork-图形拼接\">patchwork 图形拼接</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"library(patchwork)&#10;&#10;p1 &lt;- ggplot(penguins, aes(x = bill_length_mm)) + geom_histogram()&#10;p2 &lt;- ggplot(penguins, aes(x = species, y = body_mass_g)) + geom_boxplot()&#10;p3 &lt;- ggplot(penguins, aes(x = bill_length_mm, y = bill_depth_mm)) + geom_point()&#10;&#10;# 布局组合&#10;(p1 | p2) / p3 + plot_annotation(title = &quot;企鹅数据探索&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>library(patchwork)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>p1 &#x3C;- ggplot(penguins, aes(x = bill_length_mm)) + geom_histogram()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>p2 &#x3C;- ggplot(penguins, aes(x = species, y = body_mass_g)) + geom_boxplot()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>p3 &#x3C;- ggplot(penguins, aes(x = bill_length_mm, y = bill_depth_mm)) + geom_point()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 布局组合</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>(p1 | p2) / p3 + plot_annotation(title = \"企鹅数据探索\")</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"保存图形\">保存图形</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"ggsave(&quot;output.png&quot;, width = 8, height = 6, dpi = 300)&#10;ggsave(&quot;output.pdf&quot;, width = 8, height = 6)&#10;ggsave(&quot;output.svg&quot;, width = 8, height = 6)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>ggsave(\"output.png\", width = 8, height = 6, dpi = 300)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ggsave(\"output.pdf\", width = 8, height = 6)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>ggsave(\"output.svg\", width = 8, height = 6)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"ggplot2-4-0-的-s7-对象系统\">ggplot2 4.0 的 S7 对象系统</h2><p>ggplot2 4.0 迁移到 S7 带来的用户可见变化：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>make_constructor()</code> 用于创建自定义 geom/stat</li>\n<li>标度和指南（guides）可以通过包名前缀指定命名空间：<code>scale_x_continuous(guide = &quot;legendry::axis_base&quot;)</code></li>\n<li>更好的继承和类型检查机制</li>\n</ul>\n<p>对于扩展开发者，S7 提供了比 ggproto 更规范的接口定义。但对于日常使用者，API 保持向后兼容——原有代码无需修改。</p>\n<p>ggplot2 生成的图形常常需要配合数据整形使用长格式数据——<a href=\"tidyr-purrr-pipeline\">tidyr 与 purrr 管道</a>中的 <code>pivot_longer()</code> 是将宽数据转为 ggplot 所需长格式的标准工具。同时，<a href=\"dplyr-data-manipulation\">dplyr 数据操作</a>中的 <code>summarise()</code> + <code>group_by()</code> 是生成聚合数据供 ggplot2 绑定的常见前置步骤。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>ggplot2 用图形语法替代了&quot;图形类型&quot;思维，同一套组件可以组合出任意统计图形。</li>\n<li>记住 <code>aes()</code> 内外之别：映射变量用 <code>aes()</code>，固定外观写在 <code>aes()</code> 之外。</li>\n<li>图层叠加是增量式的，全局映射被继承、图层内映射覆盖或补充。</li>\n<li>标度与分面承担了大部分&quot;调整外观&quot;的需求，主题则统一管理所有非数据元素。</li>\n<li>patchwork 提供了图形拼接的运算符化接口，<code>ggsave()</code> 统一处理输出格式与尺寸。</li>\n<li>图形所需的长格式数据由 tidyr 整形得到，聚合数据由 dplyr 汇总得到——三者构成完整工作流。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"ggplot2 可视化体系","id":"ggplot2-可视化体系"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"图形语法的层次结构","id":"图形语法的层次结构"},{"level":2,"text":"美学映射（Aesthetics）","id":"美学映射-aesthetics"},{"level":3,"text":"图层继承","id":"图层继承"},{"level":2,"text":"几何对象全景","id":"几何对象全景"},{"level":2,"text":"统计变换","id":"统计变换"},{"level":2,"text":"标度系统","id":"标度系统"},{"level":2,"text":"分面（Faceting）","id":"分面-faceting"},{"level":2,"text":"主题定制","id":"主题定制"},{"level":2,"text":"坐标系","id":"坐标系"},{"level":2,"text":"组合与输出","id":"组合与输出"},{"level":3,"text":"patchwork 图形拼接","id":"patchwork-图形拼接"},{"level":3,"text":"保存图形","id":"保存图形"},{"level":2,"text":"ggplot2 4.0 的 S7 对象系统","id":"ggplot2-4-0-的-s7-对象系统"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"dplyr 数据操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/tidyverse/dplyr-data-manipulation"},"next":{"title":"tidyr 与 purrr 管道","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/tidyverse/tidyr-purrr-pipeline"}}